# kineto traces (16-66 MB each) stay local; logs, event JSONL, clocks, run summaries and tables are small and kept.
# The repo's top-level .gitignore ignores every "logs/" directory: re-include this kit's logs/ (main training logs
# ~110 KB, attn_ev JSONL, clk CSV, env, tree.sha256, nkfix stats, hang.* evidence) so a plain `git add` commits them.
!/logs/
traces/
__pycache__/
# drive.sh STOP sentinel (touch to stop before the next launch): never committed
/STOP
